# REPOMAP

./my_project
        |______ src/
        |______ main.py
        |______ utils.py
        |______ tests/
        |______ test_main.py



# PSEUDOCODE


## ./my_project/src/main.py

INPUT: Command line arguments

OUTPUT: Application result

TASK: Main entry point for the application

CONDITIONS: Python 3.8+

PREFERENCES: Use type hints


## ./my_project/src/utils.py

INPUT: Various data types

OUTPUT: Processed data

TASK: Utility functions for data processing

CONDITIONS: None

PREFERENCES: Use functional programming style


## ./my_project/tests/test_main.py

INPUT: Test parameters

OUTPUT: Test results

TASK: Unit tests for main module

CONDITIONS: pytest must be installed

PREFERENCES: Use pytest fixtures
